SET UP TYPESCRIPT FOR EXCPRESS PRJOECT: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qy8PxD3alWw 
USE as reference for proejct structure: https://github.com/arifintahu/project-structure-api/blob/main/src/api/routes/v1/roles.ts

TO RUN:

Transpile Typescript files into JS file
- npm run build

Once it is transpiled, it will go into the dist folder
Run server
- npm run start